  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:182px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/TheAx.jpg\" title=\"The Ax\"><img alt=\"The Ax\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"266\" src=\"/images/TheAx.jpg\" width=\"180\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/TheAx.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>The Ax</div></div></div>\n<p>Found on <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a>, Level 2. It's the evidence of WMDs for the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Rotgut's_WMDs\" title=\"Rotgut's WMDs\">Rotgut's WMDs</a>. It can be talked to, but has no useful information.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
